:: Widgets Passout Alley [widget]
<<widget "passoutalley">>
	<<if isPregnancyEnding()>>
		<<if $location is "alley">>
			<<pregnancyPassout "alley">>
		<<else>>
			<<pregnancyPassout "roof">>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[모든 것이 어둠에 잠긴다...|Passout alley]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Widgets Industrial Alleyways Ex [widget]

<<widget "industrialExposedPipeAttack">>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>You continue on, your heart pounding in your chest. You peek around the corner to make sure the way forward is safe. Just before you move however, a force impacts your left leg, closely followed by a sharp pain. You see the culprit as you fall to the ground, a <<person>>. <<He>> drops the metal pipe and is on top of you before you can recover.
	<br><br>
	<<pain 12>>

	<<link [[다음|Molestation Industrial]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "industrialExposedDeadEnd">>
	You come to a dead end, your path blocked by a brick wall. You hear voices coming from the way you arrived. If you go back that way, you fear your <<lewdness>> will be seen. You notice a small hole at the base of the wall, maybe large enough for you to squeeze through. You could also wait until the threat has passed.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[구멍으로 빠져나간다 (0:01)|Industrial Ex Hole]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[숨어서 그들이 지나가기를 기다린다 (0:30)|Industrial Ex Hide]]>><<pass 30>><<stress 3>><</link>><<gstress>>
	<br>
<</widget>>

<<widget "industrialExposedVanBarrel">>
	You're passing empty barrels lined up against a wall when the front of a van peeks around the corner up ahead.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[통 안에 숨는다 (0:05)|Industrial Ex Barrel]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[왔던 길로 되돌아 뛰어간다 (0:01)|Industrial Ex Run]]>><</link>><<pass 1>><<athleticsdifficulty 1 1000>>
	<br>
<</widget>>

:: Widgets Park Ex [widget]

<<widget "parkExposedAmbush">>
	<<generate1>>You move on, keeping to the bushes as much as you can. As you peek around a tree, a pair of arms wrap round you from behind and force you to the ground.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Park Woman]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "parkExposedDog">>
	<<beastNEWinit 1 dog>>
	당신 옆에서 으르렁거리는 소리가 들린다.
	<br><br>


	<<if beastSexEnabledForType("dog", $monster is 1)>>
		<<if Time.dayState isnot "night">>
		주변에 사람들이 있다. 달리면 남들 눈에 띌 것이다.
		<br><br>
		<</if>>
		<<link [[도망친다|Park Ex Run]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[가만히 있는다|Park Ex Dog Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		당신은 뒤돌아 달린다. 어찌저찌 탈출하긴 했지만, 몸은 전보다 더 만신창이가 되었다.<<beastescape>>
		<br><br>

		<<destinationeventend>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "parkExposedBridge">>
	You come to a bridge over a river. It's quite long, and if someone were to arrive while you crossed there'd be nowhere to hide.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[위험을 감수하고 다리를 건넌다|Park Ex Bridge]]>><<stress 6>><</link>><<gstress>>
	<br>
	<<link [[강을 헤엄친다|Park Ex River]]>><</link>><<swimmingdifficulty 1 500>>
	<br>
<</widget>>

:: Widgets Commercial Alleyways Ex [widget]
<<widget "commercialExposedDoorCollision">>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>You continue on, your heart pounding in your chest. You are peeking around a corner when the door beside you bursts open. A <<person>> carrying a large box rushes through, colliding with you and knocking you both to the ground. <<He>> recovers first, and seizes you by your hair.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Molestation Commercial]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "commercialExposedMannequin">>
	You are walking down an alley when you hear people up ahead. You turn back the way you came, but hear people coming from that direction as well. You look around for a way to keep your <<lewdness>> concealed, but there's nothing here except some mannequins lined up against a wall.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[마네킹인 척한다|Commercial Ex Mannequin]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<rng>>
	<<if $rng gte 61>>
		<<link [[몸을 가리고 계속 걷는다|Commercial Ex Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[몸을 가리고 계속 걷는다|Commercial Ex Exhibition]]>><</link>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "commercialExposedCardboardBox">>
	You come to the end of an alley. You peek around the corner. The path beyond is overlooked by the upper storey of a restaurant, with several patrons sitting near the edge. None look in your direction, but they're sure to see you if you continue.
	<br><br>

	뒤에서 목소리가 들린다. 당신은 골판지 상자 뒤에 숨어보지만, 상자가 너무 작아서 몸을 가려주지 못한다. 당신은 갇혔다.
	<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>

	상자 안으로 손을 뻗어본다. 상자는 비어 있다. 그 밑에는 헐거운 배수구가 있다.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[골판지 상자를 쓴다|Commercial Ex Box]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[숨어서 눈치채지 못하길 바란다|Commercial Ex Hide]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</widget>>

:: Widgets Residential Alleyways [widget]

<<widget "residentialExposedDumpsterAmbush">>
	<<generate1>>You continue on, your heart pounding in your chest. You hear voices up ahead so you move into a blind alley and duck behind a dumpster. The voices get quieter and you are about to move when the dumpster yawns open! Before you can react, a pair of arms emerge and drag you inside.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Molestation Residential]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "residentialExposedDumpsterDog">>
	<<beastNEWinit 1 dog>>
	<<if beastSexEnabledForType("dog", $monster is 1)>>
		You continue on, your heart pounding in your chest. You hear voices up ahead, so you move into a blind alley and duck behind a dumpster. The voices get louder, you recognise them from school. They stop at the end of the alley, trapping you. As you look around for an escape route you notice a stray <<beasttype>> looking at you from under a discarded newspaper.
		<br><br>

		<<bHe>>【은는】 꼬리를 흔들며 당신에게 다가와 짖기 시작한다. 당신은 그 소리가 주의를 끌지 않기를 바란다.
		<br><br>
		<<set $timer to 10>>

		<!-- Modified for Monster People -->
		<<if pcAreArmsBound("both")>>
			<<link [[견딘다|Residential Dog]]>><<set $phase to 5>><<set $noise += 1>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[`<<bhis>> 귀를 쓰다듬는다`|Residential Dog]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[견딘다|Residential Dog]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<set $noise += 1>><</link>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		당신은 가슴이 두근거리는 채 계속 나아간다. 앞쪽에서 목소리가 들려 막다른 골목으로 들어가 쓰레기통 뒤에 몸을 숨긴다. 목소리는 점점 커지고, 당신은 학교에서 들은 목소리라는 것을 알아차린다. 그들은 골목 끝에 멈춰 당신을 가둔다. 빠져나갈 길을 찾으려고 주변을 둘러보다, 버려진 신문지 밑에서 당신을 바라보는 떠돌이 <<beasttype>> 하나를 발견한다.
		<br><br>

		<<bHe>>【은는】 으르렁거리며, <span class="red">그 둘에게 들키게 만든다.</span> 그들이 다가오는 소리가 들린다.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[다음|Residential Dog Alarm]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "residentialExposedFootball">>
	<<generatey1>><<generatey2>><<person1>>
	두 줄로 늘어선 집들 사이의 길을 걷고 있는데, 축구공 하나가 담장 너머로 날아와 근처에 떨어진다. "멍청아." 담장 너머에서 <<personssimple>>의 목소리가 들린다. "가서 주워 와." 풀밭 위로 발소리가 빠르게 다가오는 것이 들린다.
	<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>

	앞쪽으로는 한참 동안 숨을 곳이 없다. 당신은 어깨너머로 힐끗 돌아본다. 되돌아가는 것도 나을 게 없다.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[공을 다시 찬다|Residential Kick]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 1 800>>
	<br>
	<<link [[다른 울타리를 넘는다|Residential Fence]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</widget>>

<<widget "residential">>
	<<if $nextPassageCheck is "Residential Alleyways">>
		<<add_link "<span class='nextLink'><<alleyicon>><<link [[주거 지구 골목 (0:05)|Residential Alleyways]]>><<pass 5>><<set $wraith.exit to 'town'>><</link>></span><br>">>
	<<else>>
		<<add_link "<<alleyicon>><<link [[주거 지구 골목 (0:05)|Residential Alleyways]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><br>">>
	<</if>>
	<<hideDisplay true>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "residentialquick">>
	<<alleyicon>><<link [[주거 지구 골목|Residential Alleyways]]>><</link>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "residentialeventend">>
	<<link [[다음|Residential Alleyways]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</widget>>

